==Trivia==
*The name of this weapon refers to [[Vampyre Houses#House Ghrazi|House Ghrazi]], a [[vampyre]] house known for their aggression and ferocity in battle.
*Despite its examine text stating the rapier has been smeared in blood, there is no visible blood on the rapier when equipped or dropped.
*Three Ghrazi rapiers, along with an uncharged scythe of vitur, can be [[Weapons (Death's Office)|seen]] leaning against a wall in [[Death's Office]].
*The weapon’s model, level requirements, examine text, and stats closely resemble those of the {{RSL|chaotic rapier}}, first introduced on 12 April 2010 in ''RuneScape 2''.

